@startuml
title Agent approval: durable decisions, model-free resume, future output
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam maxMessageSize 110
participant "Budget agent" as Budget
participant "Goal agent" as Goals
participant "Persistence boundary\nrows + checkpoints" as Store
actor User
participant "Decision boundary" as Decision
participant "Deterministic period-close\ninput/output boundary (no LLM)" as Close
== Budget adjustments ==
Budget -> Store : Save pending alert + advice + proposed limit
Budget -> Store : interrupt(waiting_for alert IDs)\nrun = awaiting_user
User -> Decision : Accept or dismiss adjustment
Decision -> Store : Commit decision + advice outcome
Decision -> Budget : Resume with alert ID and decision
Budget -> Store : Read saved decisions
alt Other proposals remain
  Budget -> Store : interrupt again
else All decided
  Budget -> Store : run = ok; remove completed checkpoint
end
note over Budget, Decision
No model call on resume; today's budget is unchanged.
A decision survives failed resume.
Still paused after failure: remain awaiting_user.
Failure after leaving pause: error.
end note
== Goal proposals ==
Goals -> Store : Save validated proposals; supersede old unanswered goals
Goals -> Goals : Clear planning payload from state
Goals -> Store : Exit checkpoint + interrupt(waiting_for goal IDs)\nrun = awaiting_user
User -> Decision : Accept or dismiss each goal
Decision -> Store : Commit goal decision
Decision -> Goals : Resume paused run without LLM
Goals -> Store : Read goal row statuses
alt Proposed goals remain
  Goals -> Store : interrupt again
else All resolved
  Goals -> Store : Finish run; remove completed checkpoint
end
note over Goals, Decision
Saved rows allow recovery when resume/checkpoint fails.
Goal CLI without a checkpointer saves proposals without pausing.
end note
== Future budget boundary ==
Store -> Close : Accepted adjustments and goals
Close -> Store : Next-period budget; expire unanswered proposals due at close
note over Store, Close
Built and wired to month-end execution.
No financial transfers or LLM decisions here.
end note
@enduml
